@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / design method. Native Git/OO/data notation illustration, not a commitment to advanced product features.
allowmixing
title Proposed — Conceptual domain model: independent identities
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam maxMessageSize 65

class ProfessionalSource <<conceptual>>
class ResumeDraft <<conceptual>>
class PublishedResumeRevision <<conceptual>>
class ShareLink <<conceptual>>
class ApplicationRecord <<conceptual>>
class SubmissionMaterialSet <<conceptual>>
ProfessionalSource "1" -- "0..*" ResumeDraft : selected source provenance
ResumeDraft "1" -- "0..*" PublishedResumeRevision : separately confirmed snapshots
ShareLink "0..*" --> "1" PublishedResumeRevision : selected publication identity
ApplicationRecord "1" -- "0..*" SubmissionMaterialSet : actual materials / provenance
SubmissionMaterialSet ..> PublishedResumeRevision : optional provenance reference

@enduml
